        "message_id_md5": "daa274a4495cef955c9d0e55b5747a54",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div dir=\"auto\"></div><br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong dir=\"auto\">Borkowska, Magda</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href=\"mailto:m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk\">m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Fri, Sep 27, 2024, 3:50 PM<br>Subject: GPS related queries<br>To: <a href=\"mailto:amin@avicennaresearch.com\">amin@avicennaresearch.com</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:amin@avicennaresearch.com\">amin@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt;, <a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt;<br>Cc: <a href=\"mailto:Paul.Mccrorie@glasgow.ac.uk\">Paul.Mccrorie@glasgow.ac.uk</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Paul.McCrorie@glasgow.ac.uk\">Paul.McCrorie@glasgow.ac.uk</a>&gt;, Fiona Caryl &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Fiona.Caryl@glasgow.ac.uk\">Fiona.Caryl@glasgow.ac.uk</a>&gt;<br>\n</div>\n<br><br>\n\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\">\n<div>\n<p>Hi Amin/Sara,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Following up on our recent meeting, I have a couple of GPS-related queries:</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n<li>Would it be possible to see the signal-to-noise ratio of your GPS data? </li>\n<li>Are you able to add additional data to the default dataset? For example, could we request additional columns indicating the precision of certain data points if we provide specific precision thresholds? </li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<p>I’ve copied Fi and Paul into this email, as they will be working on our GPS data. They might have further questions and would be able to explain better than me what specific information would be really useful to have from a research perspective.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Many thanks,</p>\n<p>Magda</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
