        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div></div><div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Dear </span><a href=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/9412\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/9412\">Amin Ghaffari</a><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">, </span><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">I forwarded this email to Zammad (Product group) to discuss with </span><a href=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/37\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/37\">Amin Tavassolian</a><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> who would be best suited to handle it. However, </span><a href=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/37\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://zammad.avicennaresearch.com/#user/profile/37\">Amin Tavassolian</a><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> also sent it to the Sales group and mentioned he would discuss it with the team. So, I will close this ticket. Thank you for your kind attention.</span><br>\n</div>",
